ok - fm-gate-ab: successive manual and baseline rounds use distinct turns and helper retries exclude failures
ok - fm-gate-ab: retained decisions attribute retired tasks while missing status measures stay unavailable
ok - fm-gate-ab: malformed, duplicated and note-only timestamps leave measures unavailable
